---
title: From uploaded asset to a file served at media.{domain}
---
flowchart LR
    accTitle: From uploaded asset to a file served at media.{domain}
    accDescr: The api worker's createAsset mints a short-lived signed PUT URL, and the uploaded bytes land in the object storage media bucket ①. The bucket's object-create notification, and the api's own upload event as a second trigger, reach the engine through the contentworker-asset-events queue, which starts exactly one AssetIngestWorkflow run per file version ②. The run reads the bytes back from object storage to hash them, probes dimensions and builds a placeholder with the image transforms binding, asks edge inference through the AI gateway for alt text, tags, extracted text and embeddings, indexes the asset in its SearchShard objects and vector index namespace, and records each step in the database ③. Publishing the asset commits its published snapshot and an asset.published outbox row to the database ④, and when the engine consumes that event, syncAssetGate writes the media gate entry in the key-value store; the engine is the only writer of the gate ⑤. A reader requests a published file URL on the media host ⑥. The uncached media gateway checks the URL's token before anything else, negotiates AVIF or WebP from Accept for a variant, and forwards a canonical URL to the cached Media entrypoint ⑦; it also serves Preview's short-lived signed draft reads straight from object storage, uncached ⑧. On a cache miss the Media entrypoint reads the gate, falling back to a database replica, and serves the original from object storage or a variant from edge image transforms, cached as immutable ⑨.

    Api[api worker: createAsset and signed PUT]:::primary
    R2[(Object storage MEDIA_BUCKET)]:::store
    D1[(Database, primary and replicas)]:::store
    Search[(SearchShardDO and vector asset indexes)]:::store
    AI([Edge inference via the AI gateway]):::external
    Images([Image transforms binding]):::external
    Reader([Browser or app reading media]):::external

    subgraph EngineW["engine worker: the only writer of the gate"]
        Ingest[[AssetIngestWorkflow, one run per file version]]:::focal
        Sync[syncAssetGate on asset events]:::primary
    end

    KV[(KV_CACHE media gate)]:::focal

    subgraph MediaW["media worker at media.&lt;domain&gt;"]
        MGw[media gateway, uncached]:::primary
        MEnt[Media entrypoint, edge cache]:::primary
    end

    Api -->|"① stores bytes from signed PUT"| R2
    R2 -.->|"② notifies object-create via asset-events"| Ingest
    Api -.->|also enqueues upload event| Ingest
    Ingest -->|"③ reads bytes to hash"| R2
    Ingest -->|probes size, builds placeholder| Images
    Ingest -->|requests alt text, tags, text, embeddings| AI
    Ingest -->|indexes asset text and vectors| Search
    Ingest -->|records ingest status| D1
    Api -->|"④ commits snapshot and outbox row on publish"| D1
    D1 -.->|relays asset.published| Sync
    Sync ==>|"⑤ writes or removes gate entry"| KV

    Reader -->|"⑥ GETs /space/env/asset/vN/token/variant/file"| MGw
    MGw ==>|"⑦ checks token, negotiates format"| MEnt
    MGw -->|"⑧ serves signed draft reads"| R2
    MEnt ==>|"⑨ reads gate on miss"| KV
    MEnt -.->|falls back on gate miss| D1
    MEnt -->|reads original| R2
    MEnt -->|transforms variants| Images

    classDef focal    stroke-width:2px,font-weight:bold
    classDef primary  stroke-width:1px
    classDef external stroke-width:1px,stroke-dasharray:4 3
    classDef store    stroke-width:1px
